      "overviewText": "This Generation Unit establishes the foundational theory of Sets, element membership notation (∈, ∉), roster and set-builder representations, standard number sets (N, Z, Q, R), empty and finite/infinite sets, subset relations (⊆, ⊂), real interval notations, power sets P(A) with cardinality 2^m, and the universal set U.",
